<title>LEBANON: Solidere shares fall on lower turnover.</title>
<headline>Solidere shares fall on lower turnover.</headline>
<dateline>BEIRUT 1996-12-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Solidere shares fell on sharply decreased turnover on the Beirut Stock Exchange on Tuesday.</p>
<p>A shares fell to $111.125 from Monday's $113.25 and B shares fell to $114.5 from $115.125.</p>
<p>Turnover in Solidere shares fell to 6,894 shares from 10,605 on Monday and value was $781,347 from $1,212,164.</p>
<p>There was no trade in the shares of the four other listed companies: Ciments Libanais, Ciments Blancs, Eternit and Uniceramic.</p>
<p>The LISPI stock index fell 0.35 percent to 82.24 and the BLOM stock index also fell 0.95 percent to 951.26.</p>
<p>-Beirut editorial (9611) 353078 645456 602057</p>
